            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rmveronica"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Hearty and wholesome. I did not have dates, but instead substituted with what I did have: blueberries (1/4 cup), cranberries (probably two tablespoons!) and chocolate chips (1/2 cup). They taste great, not too sweet, had them with homemade whipped cream sweetened with honey. Delicious!",
